```

This one is not done anymore in the `compound` function at all: https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-11-redactedcartel/blob/main/src/vaults/AutoPxGlp.sol#L238-L247

```solidity
if (gmxBaseRewardAmountIn != 0) {
