# Vulnerability details

## Impact
f for whatever reason price from oracle is = 0, returned principal and interest values are = 0 
getOutstandingDebt is called by LineOfCredit.updateOutstandingDebt which in turns is called by EscrowLib._getLatestCollateralRatio
_getLatestCollateralRatio is called by several functions within EscroLib: isLiquidatable, getCollateralRatio, releaseCollateral, addCollateral
This can cause a number of problematic scenarios: for instance if a borrower has debt with only one lender he can be liquidatable even if its collateral is healthy.

