# Vulnerability details

### Impact

In the **contracts/modules/credit/LineOfCredit.sol** a malicious `borower` can use `addCredit` several times with different `lender` addresses and `amount` 0 expanding the ids array to make a DoS(out of gas)
This DoS broke the functions `_updateOutstandingDebt`, `updateOutstandingDebt`, `accrueInterest`, `_sortIntoQ` and `borrow` who iterate the `ids` array

