# Vulnerability details

## Impact

Arbiter cannot mark the credit position as insolvent in SecureLine.sol if user keep adding a tiny amount of collateral in Escrow

Let us start with the context.arbiter can declare the credit position insolvent by calling function declareInsolvent in LineOfCredit.sol

```solidity
/// see ILineOfCredit.declareInsolvent
function declareInsolvent() external whileBorrowing returns(bool) {
	if(arbiter != msg.sender) { revert CallerAccessDenied(); }
	if(LineLib.STATUS.LIQUIDATABLE != _updateStatus(_healthcheck())) {
		revert NotLiquidatable();
	}

	if(_canDeclareInsolvent()) {
		_updateStatus(LineLib.STATUS.INSOLVENT);
