# Vulnerability details

## Impact
According to [Chainlink's documentation](https://docs.chain.link/docs/data-feeds/price-feeds/api-reference/#latestanswer), the `latestAnswer` function is deprecated. This function does not error if no answer has been reached but returns 0, causing an incorrect price fed. Use the `latestRoundData` function to get the price instead.

