# Vulnerability details

## Impact
- The **LPDA** will fail to `buy()` (mint) new NFTs even if `block.timestamp >= temp.startTime` , `block.timestamp >= temp.endTime` and `newId <= temp.finalId`
- Both the `feeReceiver` and  `saleReceiver` will never receive their funds if the price dropped more than the start price and still no one `buy()` the `finalId`

