# Vulnerability details

## Impact
There is no logic for transferring Ether that artist gain from their NFT sales in both `FixedPrice` and `OpenEdition` contracts.
For these 2 contracts there is only logic for transferring 5% fee to the protocol.
Therefore, artist will gain nothing from selling their NFT in these 2 contracts meaning they will only lose their NFT for nothing. 
Also every Ether sent from the buyer will be stuck in the contract forever 
(except the 5% of entire balance that will be sent to the `feeReceiver` at the end of the sale).


## Proof of Concept
