The recommendation to fix this issue is to implement a validation in `dropPerSecond` param:

```diff
function createLPDASale(LPDA.Sale calldata sale) external returns (address clone) {
  ...
  require(sale.dropPerSecond > 0, "INVALID DROP PER SECOND");
+ uint256 duration = sale.endTime - sale.startTime;
+ require(sale.startPrice >= sale.dropPerSecond * duration, "DROP PER SECOND TOO BIG");
	...
}
```

