# Vulnerability details


## Impact
Fund in LPDA contract will be locked forever.

## Proof of Concept

If the LPDA is configured in `initialize()` with Sale param satisfies: `startPrice < (endTime-startTime) * dropPerSecond`, all fund in the contract will be locked forever after block time T (`T > startPrice / dropPerSecond + startTime`).

Because after the time T, the [`getPrice()`](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-12-escher/blob/5d8be6aa0e8634fdb2f328b99076b0d05fefab73/src/minters/LPDA.sol#L117-L125) function will  always fail due to arithmetic overflow.
This will cause its calling functions [`buy()`](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-12-escher/blob/5d8be6aa0e8634fdb2f328b99076b0d05fefab73/src/minters/LPDA.sol#L58) and [`refund()`](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-12-escher/blob/5d8be6aa0e8634fdb2f328b99076b0d05fefab73/src/minters/LPDA.sol#L99) to fail as well.

