# Lines of code

https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-12-escher/blob/main/src/minters/LPDAFactory.sol#L29-L42
https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-12-escher/blob/main/src/minters/FixedPriceFactory.sol#L29-L38
