# Vulnerability details

## Impact
The new added require and checks to the contract ensure that the buyer is not purchasing more editions than are currently available, thus preventing potential overspending. This also guarantees that the buyer is not purchasing editions that have already been purchased by someone else. Additionally, this helps to protect the seller from potential fraud and malicious attacks.

