# Vulnerability details


## Impact
Buyers may spend ETH but get nothing or get a fake Escher721 NFT

## Proof of Concept

The project tries to protect users by allowing only `CREATOR_ROLE` to create Escher721 contracts in [Escher721Factory.sol#createContract()](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-12-escher/blob/5d8be6aa0e8634fdb2f328b99076b0d05fefab73/src/Escher721Factory.sol#L27-L42):
```solidity
function createContract(
    string memory _name,
    string memory _symbol,
    address _uri
) external returns (address escherClone) {
    require(escher.hasRole(escher.CREATOR_ROLE(), msg.sender), "NOT AUTHORIZED");
    ...
}
```

But, the minter factories(FixedPriceFactory, LPDAFactory, OpenEditionFactory) does not check whether the edition to be sold is a valid Escher721 contract:

```solidity
function createLPDASale(LPDA.Sale calldata sale) external returns (address clone) {
    require(IEscher721(sale.edition).hasRole(bytes32(0x00), msg.sender), "NOT AUTHORIZED");
    ...
    emit NewLPDAContract(msg.sender, sale.edition, clone, sale);
}
```

A malicious seller can create an entirely fake contract or wrap an Escher721 contract and create a new sale(e.g. FixedPrice) through the factory(FixedPriceFactory).
Buyers calling `buy()` of this sale will get nothing or some fake Escher721 NFTs.

## Tools Used
VS Code

## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Only valid Escher721 contracts created from official [Escher721Factory.sol#createContract()](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-12-escher/blob/5d8be6aa0e8634fdb2f328b99076b0d05fefab73/src/Escher721Factory.sol#L27-L42) by `CREATOR_ROLE`s can be sold by official minters.

Should record all contracts in Escher721Factory, and check the validity of `sale.edition` when creating new sales in official minter factories:

```solidity
diff --git a/src/Escher721Factory.sol b/src/Escher721Factory.sol
index 9eb2771..92d517a 100644
--- a/src/Escher721Factory.sol
+++ b/src/Escher721Factory.sol
@@ -5,12 +5,14 @@ import {Escher} from "./Escher.sol";
 import {Escher721} from "./Escher721.sol";
 import {Clones} from "openzeppelin/proxy/Clones.sol";
 import {ITokenUriDelegate} from "./interfaces/ITokenUriDelegate.sol";
+import {IEscher721Registry} from "./interfaces/IEscher721Registry.sol";

-contract Escher721Factory {
+contract Escher721Factory is IEscher721Registry {
     using Clones for address;

     Escher public immutable escher;
     address public immutable implementation;
+    mapping(address => bool) private registry;

     event NewEscher721Contract(address indexed creator, address indexed clone, address indexed uri);

@@ -34,9 +36,15 @@ contract Escher721Factory {
         escherClone = implementation.clone();
         address uriClone = _uri.clone();

+        registry[escherClone] = true;
+
         Escher721(escherClone).initialize(msg.sender, uriClone, _name, _symbol);
         ITokenUriDelegate(uriClone).initialize(msg.sender);

         emit NewEscher721Contract(msg.sender, escherClone, uriClone);
     }
+
+    function isValid(address escher721) external view returns (bool) {
+        return registry[escher721];
+    }
 }
diff --git a/src/minters/FixedPriceFactory.sol b/src/minters/FixedPriceFactory.sol
index a84e79e..8ff58d1 100644
--- a/src/minters/FixedPriceFactory.sol
+++ b/src/minters/FixedPriceFactory.sol
