# Vulnerability details

In the contract Escher721.sol a corrupted MINTER_ROLE can mine a large number of tokens without being able to delete it.


    function mint(address to, uint256 tokenId) public virtual onlyRole(MINTER_ROLE) {
        _mint(to, tokenId);
    }


Recommended Mitigation Steps:
Add a modifier of MINTER_ROLE

