## Tools Used
Manual code review

## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Restrict Access: Implement access controls to restrict who can call the payableCall function. Ideally, only the owner of the virtual account or an approved entity should be able to invoke this function.
Whitelist Contracts: Consider implementing a whitelist of contracts that the payableCall function can interact with. This would prevent arbitrary and potentially malicious contract interactions.


