## Tools Used

Manual review, Foundry tests

## Recommended Mitigation Steps

Consider making factories semi-permissionless as in anyone can create `BridgeAgent`s with custom routers, but the governance have to allow them before they are used. An alternative more drastic solution would be to disallow router access from `VirtualAccount`.


