# Vulnerability details

## Impact
The function is only checking if the price is not 0 or less than 0 but is not checking if the price is stale, which can lead to wrong/outdated prices. 

## Proof of Concept

https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-07-amphora/blob/main/core/solidity/contracts/periphery/oracles/ChainlinkStalePriceLib.sol#L10-L15

