## Recommended Mitigation Steps
 It is difficult for me to recommend concrete, simple, mitigations since this exploit is a result of what seems to be `intended` functionality of the protocol. However, I will point out that this exploit is not profitable if the loans in the term were required to be over-collateralized. However, the ECG is made to support an abundance of terms with various different parameters and therefore overcollateralization may not always be required.





