## Recommended Mitigation Steps
In `calculateFunding()`, for each for loop, instead of revert when a strike price has been updated, simply skip one iteration and continue to the next iteration. Consider changing the `_validate(
        latestFundingPerStrike[strikes[i]] != latestFundingPaymentPointer,
        5
      );` to `if...continue`






