Please replace placeholders such as `YOUR_ETHEREUM_RPC_URL`, `YOUR_PRIVATE_KEY`, `YOUR_CONTRACT_ADDRESS`, `CUSTOM_TOKEN_ADDRESS`, and '`APPROVAL_AMOUNT`' with appropriate values for your testing environment.

