## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Add a function to the contract that allows users to reset or revoke token approvals for specific tokens. This function should accept the token address as a parameter and set the approval amount to zero or revoke the approval entirely, depending on the token's behavior. Also, developers can ensure this function is user-friendly, allowing users to easily manage and revoke approvals for tokens they have previously granted to the contract.



