### Recommended Mitigation Steps

Since in solidity floating value can not be used so directly calculating rsEth price in Eth form can create problems because whenever `totalETHInPool` is less than `rsEthSupply` then rsEth price is 0 Eth.
So in solidity we should use some constant multiplier to use as decimals like **10e18**. So it will return proper price of rsEth in Eth even if `totalETHInPool` is less than `rsEthSupply`.

