# Vulnerability details

## Impact
When users deposit assets using `LRTDepositPool.depositAsset`, the amount of `rsETH` token minted for the users is not calculated correctly and users will lose funds.

## Proof of Concept
When users deposit to the pool, in the `depositAsset` function, the amount of asset from users first transfered to the pool and after that the rsETH token is minted.

