# Vulnerability details

## Impact
If `latestAnswer` is stale, the price of RSETH will be incorrect.

## Proof of Concept
According to [Chainlink docs](https://docs.chain.link/data-feeds/api-reference#latestanswer), `latestAnswer` is deprecated.

`latestRoundData` is supported in ETH LSD projects that Eigenlayer supports.
- [CBETH / ETH](https://etherscan.io/address/0xf017fcb346a1885194689ba23eff2fe6fa5c483b#readContract)
- [STETH / ETH](https://etherscan.io/address/0x86392dc19c0b719886221c78ab11eb8cf5c52812#readContract)
- [RETH / ETH](https://etherscan.io/address/0x536218f9e9eb48863970252233c8f271f554c2d0#readContract)

## Tools Used
Manual.

## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Replace `latestAnswer` with `latestRoundData` and add a check for `updatedAt`.
https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-11-kelp/blob/main/src/LRTOracle.sol#L45-L47
```solidity
