```

The second solution is to use [already applied solutions](https://blog.openzeppelin.com/a-novel-defense-against-erc4626-inflation-attacks) for 4626 vault inflation attacks. A *BALANCE_OFFSET* can be used on the approved asset supply, to reduce the effect of donation attacks. However for the main attack demonstrated above, just a *SHARE_OFFSET* is sufficient. Depending on the value of *SHARE_OFFSET*, this can greatly increase the cost of the attack demonstrated above, and prevents the situation where victims are m

