        address deployer_ = msg.sender;
        tokenId = getCustomTokenId(deployer_, salt);
|>      _deployRemoteTokenManager(tokenId, destinationChain, gasValue, tokenManagerType, params);
        emit CustomTokenIdClaimed(tokenId, deployer_, salt);
    }
//The vulnerability is similar in deployAndRegisterRemoteStandardizedToken().
```
(https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-07-axelar/blob/2f9b234bb8222d5fbe934beafede56bfb4522641/contracts/its/interchain-token-service/InterchainTokenService.sol#L334)
(https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-07-axelar/blob/2f9b234bb8222d5fbe934beafede56bfb4522641/contracts/its/interchain-token-service/InterchainTokenService.sol#L374)
(https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-07-axelar/blob/2f9b234bb8222d5fbe934beafede56bfb4522641/contracts/its/interchain-token-service/InterchainTokenService.sol#L428)

Then in `_deployRemoteStandardizedToken()`, `gasValue` is directly passed to `_callContract` to pay for gas.
```solidity
//InterchainTokenService.sol - _deployRemoteStandardizedToken()
...
        _callContract(destinationChain, payload, gasValue, msg.sender);
...
```solidity
//InterchainTokenservice.sol- _callContract()
...
        if (gasValue > 0) {
            gasService.payNativeGasForContractCall{ value: gasValue }(
                address(this),
                destinationChain,
