## Impact
protcol uses uniswap oracle but modified some its maths which leads to some round errors .This can affect liquidation time as a user who have made his calculation with unisawp oracle math with same protocol parameter will be liquidated because of some rounds arrors . 
## Proof of Concept
protocol uses _getRatioAtTick() and modified it but uniswap uses getSqrtRatioAtTick() and then squre the result to get the ratio while protocol goes directly to get ratio this however have some round issues
