# Lines of code

https://github.com/Tapioca-DAO/tapioca-periph-audit/blob/main/contracts/oracle/implementations/ARBTriCryptoOracle.sol#L130


# Vulnerability details

## Impact
The vulnerability arises from the possibility of an arithmetic overflow occurring during the calculation of _basePrices. If the product of the three variables _minWbtcPrice, _ethPrice, and _usdtPrice exceeds the maximum representable value for a uint256 variable, it will wrap around and produce an unexpected and incorrect result. This could lead to an inaccurate LP token price calculation, potentially impacting financial transactions relying on this value.

## Proof of Concept

     /// @notice Calculated the price of 1 LP token
    /// @return _maxPrice the current value
