#### Expected output:
```bash
Collateral amt:  BigNumber { value: "10000000000000000000000" }
WBTC borrow val:  BigNumber { value: "74000000" }
[$] Original price:  BigNumber { value: "10000" }
Price Drop: 120%
Running First Liquidate...
[*] First Liquidate Runs

Running second Liquidate...
[*] Second Liquidate Runs (Bug)
      ✔ POCFinal (2072ms)
