# Vulnerability details

## Impact

Dust amount of shares stuck in the contract. 

## Proof of Concept

When wrapping and unwrapping USDY to rUSDY, there is a moment where some shares get stuck in the contract. Normally, if a user wraps 100 USDY for 10 days and unwraps the rUSDY.balanceOf(user), he will get his full amount of USDY back. However, if the user wraps 100 USDY for 10 days and decides to unwrap 99 rUSDY, wait for another 10 days and unwrap the rest of the rUSDY balance, some shares will get stuck in the contract and the user will not be able to get the dust amount of rUSDY (~9400 wei of shares) back to USDY. 

I have written a test to show this problem. Insert the test into the rUSDY_dynamic.t.sol file and run the command: 

> forge test --match-test test_stuck_rUSDY_wrap_wait_unwrap -vv

```
 function test_stuck_rUSDY_wrap_wait_unwrap() public dealAlice {
    deal(address(usdy),address(alice),300e18);
        console.log("The new rusdy balance of alice: ", rUSDYToken.balanceOf(alice));
    console.log("The usdy balance of alice: ", usdy.balanceOf(alice));
    console.log("The new shares of alice: ", rUSDYToken.sharesOf(alice));
    console.log("-----------------AFTER WRAP----------------------");
    vm.startPrank(alice);
    usdy.approve(address(rUSDYToken), 300e18);

    rUSDYToken.wrap(100e18);
    console.log("The new rusdy balance of alice: ", rUSDYToken.balanceOf(alice));
    console.log("The usdy balance of alice: ", usdy.balanceOf(alice));
    console.log("The new shares of alice: ", rUSDYToken.sharesOf(alice));

    console.log("-----------------AFTER 10 DAYS----------------------");

    vm.warp(block.timestamp + 10 days);

    console.log("The new rusdy balance of alice: ", rUSDYToken.balanceOf(alice));
    console.log("The usdy balance of alice: ", usdy.balanceOf(address(rUSDYToken)));
    console.log("The new shares of alice: ", rUSDYToken.sharesOf(alice));
    console.log("-----------------AFTER UNWRAP----------------------");

    rUSDYToken.unwrap(99e18);
    console.log("The new rusdy balance of alice: ", rUSDYToken.balanceOf(alice));
    console.log("The usdy balance of alice: ", usdy.balanceOf(alice));
    console.log("The new shares of alice: ", rUSDYToken.sharesOf(alice));
   console.log("-----------------AFTER 10 DAYS----------------------");
    vm.warp(block.timestamp + 10 days);

    rUSDYToken.unwrap(rUSDYToken.balanceOf(alice));
        console.log("The new rusdy balance of alice: ", rUSDYToken.balanceOf(alice));
    console.log("The usdy balance of alice: ", usdy.balanceOf(alice));
    console.log("The new shares of alice: ", rUSDYToken.sharesOf(alice));
    console.log("--------------------------------------------------------");
```

The test should pass with these logs:

```
[PASS] test_stuck_rUSDY_wrap_wait_unwrap() (gas: 570059)
Logs:
  The new rusdy balance of alice:  0
  The usdy balance of alice:  300000000000000000000
  The new shares of alice:  0
  -----------------AFTER WRAP----------------------
  The new rusdy balance of alice:  100000000000000000000
  The usdy balance of alice:  200000000000000000000
