The last line of the logs shows that alice has 9441 wei of shares left in the contract. I was looking for the reason that caused this problem for hours and I couldn't find it, but my suspicion is in this line when calling unwwrap()

```
  function unwrap(uint256 _rUSDYAmount) external whenNotPaused {
    require(_rUSDYAmount > 0, "rUSDY: can't unwrap zero rUSDY tokens");
    uint256 usdyAmount = getSharesByRUSDY(_rUSDYAmount);
>   if (usdyAmount < BPS_DENOMINATOR) revert UnwrapTooSmall();
