```



## Tools Used
yarn 


## Recommended Mitigation Steps
If `usdyAmount` mods `BPS_DENOMINATOR` is not equal to zero, then set the value of `usdyAmount` to `usdyAmount / BPS_DENOMINATOR * BPS_DENOMINATOR`.

