## Recommended Mitigation Steps  
Consider using the [Uniswap V3 `FullMath.sol`](https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/main/contracts/libraries/FullMath.sol) library in price calculations. This supports math in the 512 bit-space and handles overflows of intermediate values.








