How do we prove it is because the lack of approval? We can edit the EthRouter.sol code and add the approval code and the test case above would pass.

https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-04-caviar/blob/cd8a92667bcb6657f70657183769c244d04c015c/src/EthRouter.sol#L271

