import {ERC20} from "solmate/tokens/ERC20.sol";
```

then in function change in EthRouter.sol, we give the token allowance to PrivatePool if the base token is not address(0)

```solidity
            address baseToken = PrivatePool(_change.pool).baseToken();
            if (baseToken != address(0)) {
                ERC20(baseToken).approve(address(_change.pool), 10000 ether);
            }

            PrivatePool(_change.pool).change{value: msg.value}(
