draftQueues[draftEra][C] = queue(80, availableAt);

totalDrafts = 40+60+80 = 180
```

4. Due to unfortunate condition, RSR needs to be seized. 
5. `seizeRSR` function is called which resulted in draftRSR to be reduced by amount 41. Remember seizing does not changes totalDrafts

