Hardhat

## Recommended Mitigation Steps
The `battery.lastBlock` value must be initialized in the `init` function of `RTokenP1`
```solidity
    function init(
        // ...
    ) external initializer {
        // ...
        battery.lastBlock = uint48(block.number);
    }
```

