However, inside `signature_verifier.verify`, it doesn't verify if the provided `signatures` come from the same validator, allowing validator to provide repeated valid signature `signatures` to easily bypass the `required_validators`.

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-08-chakra/blob/main/solidity/settlement/contracts/SettlementSignatureVerifier.sol#L206-L210
