## Impact

The minor impact is that the `setParameter()` function can never be called to change the `feed` or `auraPriceOracle` because it has the `onlyRole(VAULT_CONFIG_ROLE)` modifier.

The critical impact is because `setVaultConfig()` function can never be called to initialize the `vaultConfig`.

