# Vulnerability details

## Impact
The [NoyaValueOracle.getValue](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/9c79b332eff82011dcfa1e8fd51bad805159d758/contracts/helpers/valueOracle/NoyaValueOracle.sol#L71) function calculates the value of `asset` token based on `baseToken` using `priceRoutes[asset][baseToken]`.
However, while looping, it only changes the `quotingToken` without actually using it. As a result, the function returns an incorrect value or may revert.

## Proof of Concept
The `NoyaValueOracle.getValue` function calculates the value of `asset` token based on `baseToken` using `priceRoutes[asset][baseToken]`.

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/9c79b332eff82011dcfa1e8fd51bad805159d758/contracts/helpers/SwapHandler/GenericSwapAndBridgeHandler.sol#L90-L140

```Solodity
