```

Here, `quotingToken` is resonposible to bridge the price route from `asset` to `baseToken`.
While looping, it just changes the `quotingToken` from L90 and doesn't use it from L89.
This leads to an invalid calculation of the `asset` token's value based on the `baseToken`, or the calculation may revert.

