```

3. As an example, if we take the [StargateConnector.sol](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/main/contracts/connectors/StargateConnector.sol) contract, we can see that it queries the price from the NoyaValueOracle on the last line. This incorrect price is returned to the OmnichainNormalChainManager that reports it to the base chain.

