```
Once the trove is opened Keeper or Manager has to call this function in order to give approval to the troveManager 


This [_approveOperations()](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/main/contracts/helpers/BaseConnector.sol#L277) function is used give the allowance to the Trove manager 

