``` 

In above calls the [BorrowersOperation](https://etherscan.io/address/0x72c590349535AD52e6953744cb2A36B409542719#code) function which is On-chain contract we can see below.

```solidity
    function closeTrove(ITroveManager troveManager, address account) external callerOrDelegated(account) {
        IERC20 collateralToken;

        uint256 price;
        bool isRecoveryMode;
        uint256 totalPricedCollateral;
        uint256 totalDebt;
        (collateralToken, price, totalPricedCollateral, totalDebt, isRecoveryMode) = _getCollateralAndTCRData(
            troveManager
        );
