```
So by above steps we can see there is no step involved which revoke the approval. After the trove closed the Zap contract still have the last updated approval amount.


## Impact
The revocation of approval is not triggered after the trove is closed, even in the PrismaConnector leads to unexpected events which cause loss directly to the protocol.

