As the connector does not have enough balance the retrieve reverted. 
Now if you comment line `connector.supply(USDC, IERC20(USDC).balanceOf(address(connector)));` & uncomment this line: `connector.supply(USDC, 100e6);` you will see the withdrawal will be executed correctly, because only 100e6 of 200e6 USDC was deposited in pool & connector still has 100e6 to cover withdrawal of 50e6 USDC.

> **This issue is present in all connector contracts, not just in AaveConnector.sol.**
## Tools Used
Manual review, Foundry
## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Do not allow to deposit all balance in deposit pool, it will be good enough if it allows only 50% of total connector balance. Or add a timelock in AaveConnector::supply() so that it can be executed at right time.





