# Vulnerability details

## Summary:
When `getPositionTVL()` is called on `DolomiteConnector`, it gets the `totalCollateral` & `totalDebt` of the position and returns the delta between the two, however in a certain where the position is in debt, an arithmetic error `0x11` will be thrown, thereby reverting the loop to which the `getTVL()` runs to get the `TVL` of the accounting manager, this will brick the `totalAssets()` which returns the `TVL` for the calculation of shares and assets to be given out during `withdraw()` or `deposit()`

## Vulnerability Details:
On the call to `getPositionTVL()` on the `DolomiteConnector` to get the `totalCollateral` & `totalDebt`:

[Dolomite.sol#L106-L122](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/9c79b332eff82011dcfa1e8fd51bad805159d758/contracts/connectors/Dolomite.sol#L106C1-L122C6)
```solidity
    function _getPositionTVL(HoldingPI memory p, address base) public view override returns (uint256 tvl) {
        uint256 accountId = abi.decode(p.data, (uint256));

        (uint256[] memory markets, address[] memory tokens,, Types.Wei[] memory amounts) =
            dolomiteMargin.getAccountBalances(Info(address(this), accountId));
        uint256 totalDebt = 0;
        uint256 totalCollateral = 0;
        for (uint256 i = 0; i < markets.length; i++) {
            uint256 value = valueOracle.getValue(tokens[i], base, amounts[i].value);
            if (amounts[i].sign) {
                totalCollateral += value;
            } else {
                totalDebt += value;
            }
        }
  @>    return totalCollateral - totalDebt;
    }
```
The issue here is whenever the position is in debt where(`totalDebt` is greater than `totalCollateral`) it goes on to subtract the `totalDebt` from the `totalCollateral` leading to an arithmetic error, instead of returning `zero`.
In the  `DolomiteConnector` the health factor of the positions isn't checked when withdrawing or opening a borrow position making this scenario more likely to happen, and this will undoubtedly affect the core functionalities of the accounting manager since on the call to [`totalAssets()`](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/main/contracts/accountingManager/AccountingManager.sol#L591C1-L593C6) it returns the [`TVL()`](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/main/contracts/accountingManager/AccountingManager.sol#L627C1-L630C6) of the vault which is calculated by looping through all the positions held by the vault:

[AccountingManager.sol#L591-L593](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/main/contracts/accountingManager/AccountingManager.sol#L591C1-L593C6)
```solidity
    /// @notice by overriding the totalAssets function, we can calculate the total assets of the vault and use the 4626 standard to calculate the shares price
    function totalAssets() public view override returns (uint256) {
        return TVL();
    }
```
[AccountingManager.sol#L627-L630](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/main/contracts/accountingManager/AccountingManager.sol#L627C1-L630C6)
```solidity
    function TVL() public view returns (uint256) {
        return TVLHelper.getTVL(vaultId, registry, address(baseToken)) + baseToken.balanceOf(address(this))
            - depositQueue.totalAWFDeposit;
    }
```
If a position's `calculatorConnector` is the `DolomiteConnector`, if the position is in debt the revert on  `totalCollateral - totalDebt` will brick the loop causing any function using `totalAssets()` for calculations to revert:

[TVLHelper.sol#L14-L34](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/9c79b332eff82011dcfa1e8fd51bad805159d758/contracts/helpers/TVLHelper.sol#L14C1-L34C6)
```solidity
    function getTVL(uint256 vaultId, PositionRegistry registry, address baseToken) public view returns (uint256) {
        uint256 totalTVL;
        uint256 totalDebt;
        HoldingPI[] memory positions = registry.getHoldingPositions(vaultId);
        for (uint256 i = 0; i < positions.length; i++) {
            if (positions[i].calculatorConnector == address(0)) {
                continue;
            }
            uint256 tvl = IConnector(positions[i].calculatorConnector).getPositionTVL(positions[i], baseToken);
            bool isPositionDebt = registry.isPositionDebt(vaultId, positions[i].positionId);
            if (isPositionDebt) {
                totalDebt += tvl;
            } else {
                totalTVL += tvl;
            }
        }
        if (totalTVL < totalDebt) {
            return 0;
        }
        return (totalTVL - totalDebt);
    }
```

## Impact:
