# Lines of code

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/9c79b332eff82011dcfa1e8fd51bad805159d758/contracts/helpers/valueOracle/oracles/ChainlinkOracleConnector.sol#L125-L126


# Vulnerability details

## Impact
Any asset's chainlink oracle price become stale will DOS `TVL()` flow, due to vulnerable oracle implementation.

## Proof of Concept
In ChainlinkOracleConnector::getValueFromChainlinkFeed, if the chainlink price feed becomes stale, `getValueFromChainlinkFeed()` will directly revert. No try-catch or fallback oracle is implemented.

This puts protocol TVL calculation at risk of DOS if any of the chainlink price feed becomes stale.
```solidity
//contracts/helpers/valueOracle/oracles/ChainlinkOracleConnector.sol
    function getValueFromChainlinkFeed(
        AggregatorV3Interface source,
        uint256 amountIn,
        uint256 sourceTokenUnit,
        bool isInverse
    ) public view returns (uint256) {
        int256 price;
        uint256 updatedAt;
        (, price, , updatedAt, ) = source.latestRoundData();
        uint256 uintprice = uint256(price);
        //@audit  Any asset's chainlink oracle price become stale will DOS TVL() flow, due to vulnerable oracle implementation. 
        if (block.timestamp - updatedAt > chainlinkPriceAgeThreshold) {
|>          revert NoyaChainlinkOracle_DATA_OUT_OF_DATE();
        }
...
```
(https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/9c79b332eff82011dcfa1e8fd51bad805159d758/contracts/helpers/valueOracle/oracles/ChainlinkOracleConnector.sol#L125-L126)

Note that in each connector's getPositionTVL() calculation, [NoyaValueOracle::getValue](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/9c79b332eff82011dcfa1e8fd51bad805159d758/contracts/helpers/valueOracle/NoyaValueOracle.sol#L71) is called which will [pass the call to either a chainlink oracle(ChainlinkOracleConnector.sol) or uniswapV3 oracle(UniswapValueOracle.sol)](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/9c79b332eff82011dcfa1e8fd51bad805159d758/contracts/helpers/valueOracle/NoyaValueOracle.sol#L109). When any asset's ChainlinkOracleConnector::getValue revert due to stale price, NoyaValueOracle::getValue will not wrap the revert in try-catch or implement a fallback UniswapValueOracle.sol, the entire [TVL()](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-noya/blob/9c79b332eff82011dcfa1e8fd51bad805159d758/contracts/accountingManager/AccountingManager.sol#L628) tx will revert.

## Tools Used
Manual
## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Consider either in ChainlinkOracleConnector.sol adding a fall-back call to UniswapValueOracle when the asset price feed is stale, or add a try-catch in NoyaValueOracle::getValue and implement the fallback oracle.


