        }
```

Even later there are liquidity created by checkpoint and [the periodSecondsInsideX96 is updated](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-10-ramses-exchange/blob/236e9e9e0cf452828ab82620b6c36c1e6c7bb441/contracts/CL/core/libraries/Position.sol#L253), the fresh periodSecondsInsideX96 value cannot be returned because periodAmountsWritten[period][_positionHash] is already set.

```solidity
        periodSecondsInsideX96 = FullMath.mulDiv(liquidity, secondsPerLiquidityInsideX128, FixedPoint32.Q32);
```

Then user can abuse this cachePeriodEarned to write a stale and low value of periodSecondsInsideX96 to reduce other owner's reward because the final reward computation is:

```solidity
        amount = FullMath.mulDiv(
            tokenTotalSupplyByPeriod[period][token],
            periodSecondsInsideX96,
            WEEK << 96
        );
```


## Recommended Mitigation Steps

Add authorization for function cachePeriodEarned



