Manual Review

## Recommended Mitigation Steps
It is recommended to modify loop statement as follows:
```solidity
--- for (uint256 k = 0; k < len; ++k) {
--- for (uint256 k = 0; k <= len; ++k) {
        if (b.erc20s[j] == erc20sAll[k]) {
            erc20Index = k;
            break;
        }
    }
```


