        TradeRequest memory req,
        TradePrices memory prices,
        ITrading caller
    ) private returns (ITrade) {

      ...
      require(dutchAuctionLength != 0, "dutch auctions not enabled");
      ...
}
```

Same thing happend with [batch auction](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-07-reserve/blob/main/contracts/p1/Broker.sol#L245C9-L245C72). 

