297:        uint192 needed = range.top.mul(ctx.quantities[i], CEIL); // {tok}
    }
}    
```
If the `range.top` exceeds `type(uint64).max` (approximately `2e19`), the calculation will revert(`line 264`). 
```
function mul(
    uint192 x,
    uint192 y,
    RoundingMode rounding
) internal pure returns (uint192) {
264:    return _safeWrap(_divrnd(uint256(x) * uint256(y), FIX_SCALE, rounding));
}
```
Given that `FIX_SCALE` is `1e18`, the `top` can easily exceed `2e19`, causing the calculation to revert. 

This issue can also cause `custom redemptions` to revert(`line 598`).
