Assuming rare use case of liquidator developer want to deposit both USDC,WETH in same transaction without deploying smart contract.
`Multicall` is the only way to go. However, it will revert due to validation.

Fixing deposit for better validation is quite simple, it allow user to deposit both USDC and WETH in same transaction.
This will make liquidator bot easier to develop.

