## Impact
The impact of this vulnerability is that it can cause valid transactions to fail due to incorrect assumptions about slippage tolerance handling. This may lead to disruptions in contract execution and potentially affect user experience and financial operations relying on SlippageLib.checkPrice.
## Tools Used
Manual. Foundry
## Recommended Mitigation Steps
ensure that the SlippageLib.checkPrice function properly handles scenarios where slippageTolerance is set to zero. 





