❌            || block.timestamp > 2 hours + timeStamp;
```


But this same value isn't checked for staleness anytime it is not the oracle of the asset a transaction uses. It is used with the asset's oracle to retrieve the price of the asset in ETH as `priceInEth`.

**[LibOracle.sol#L33-L45](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-dittoeth/blob/91faf46078bb6fe8ce9f55bcb717e5d2d302d22e/contracts/libraries/LibOracle.sol#L33-L45)**
