The code calls `oracleCircuitBreaker()` above but the function does not include the staleness check as seen below.

**[LibOracle.sol#L125-L126](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-dittoeth/blob/91faf46078bb6fe8ce9f55bcb717e5d2d302d22e/contracts/libraries/LibOracle.sol#L125-L126)**
