# Vulnerability details


## Proof of Concept

Take a look at https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-renzo/blob/1c7cc4e632564349b204b4b5e5f494c9b0bc631d/contracts/RestakeManager.sol#L491-L576

```solidity
