## Recommended Mitigation Steps

First, this issue has a part that is very connected to the issue refereed in the beginning of this report (Forehead section). But, it dose not fully mitigate this issue as we should not allow users to use `unboundedKerosineVault` unless it is ready and has the full set of vaults that used to calculate the TVL.
Here is a git diff that compounding the mitigation of the conflicted usage of Kerosene Manger and this issue:

