## Recommended Mitigation Steps
During the liquidation of a `NOTE` burn relative `DYAD` tokens to the amount of collateral transferred. This leaves the underwater `NOTE` position up for further liquidation instead of the current implementation of burning all the minted `DYAD` related to the `NOTE` but only sending part of the collateral.








