## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Do not add the `unboundedKerosineVault` to the `vaultLicenser` in the deploy script `DeployV2`. Consider introducing a separate licenser for licensing Kerosene vaults. Currently the `KerosineManager` seems to have the dual purpose of licensing Kerosene vaults and tracking exogenous vaults for calculating TVL in `UnboundedKerosineVault::assetPrice`. 


