## Recommended Mitigation Steps

Keep separate vault address sets in the `KerosineManager` for licensing and Kerosene price calculation.

### Changes to `KerosineManager`

1. Add a `licensedVaults` address set at [KerosineManager.sol#L16](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-dyad/blob/cd48c684a58158de444b24854ffd8f07d046c31b/src/core/KerosineManager.sol#L16)
```solidity
EnumerableSet.AddressSet private licensedVaults;
```

2. Add functions to add and remove vaults to the `licensedVaults` address set for `KerosineManager`.
```solidity
function addLicensedVault(address vault) external onlyOwner {
  if (!licensedVaults.add(vault)) revert VaultAlreadyAdded();
}
function removeLicensedVault(address vault) external onlyOwner {
  if (!licensedVaults.remove(vault)) revert VaultNotFound();
}
```

3. Update the `isLicensed` function to use the new `licensedVaults` address set at [KerosineManager.sol#L50](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-dyad/blob/cd48c684a58158de444b24854ffd8f07d046c31b/src/core/KerosineManager.sol#L50)
```solidity
return licensedVaults.contains(vault);
```

### Changes to `Deploy.V2`

1. License the Kerosene vaults at [Deploy.V2.s.sol#L95-L96](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-dyad/blob/cd48c684a58158de444b24854ffd8f07d046c31b/script/deploy/Deploy.V2.s.sol#L95-L96) using the new `addLicensedVault` function, replacing the current `vaultLicenser` calls.
```solidity
kerosineManager.addLicensedVault(address(unboundedKerosineVault));
// kerosineManager.addLicensedVault(address(boundedKerosineVault));
```


