# Vulnerability details


## Impact
The `vaultManager` that is created in the deployment script is not licensed to the `Licenser` of `Dyad` so that any calls from the `vaultManager` to `Dyad` functions that invoke the `licensedVaultManager` modifier will revert. The `vaultManager` functions `mintDyad`, `burnDyad` and `liquidate` will all revert because they call `Dyad::mint` and `Dyad::burn`.

