The dyad is backed by  depositing assets in a vault or several vaults. The redeem function is not taking in consideration that a user may have others vaults as well. so when the redeemDyad function is burning the dyad it's passing the whole amount to withdraw from a vault and user may have less amount that the value passing in the function (see arrow above);

