## POC

We can imagine a scenario in which the WETH oracle works as intended, but the stETH oracle has had a delay in reporting prices

Any user could purposefully deposit 1 wei of STETH and add it to their vaults as a means to ensure that that Vault is also queried when computing `getNonKeroseneValue`

This will cause the liquidation to not work in spite of the main Vault working and being liquidatable

## Mitigation

Consider if:
- You should use a last known price to allow liquidations in case of high congestion
- Vaults should be separate as to prevent this scenario



