# Vulnerability details

## Impact
User can borrow above daily debt limit by repaying before borrowing.

## Proof of Concept
1. Borrow
2. Wait 1 day
3. Borrow 0 to reset daily limit
4. Repay to increase limit
5. Borrow above daily limit set at step 3

```solidity
