# Vulnerability details

## Impact
The concern is to address the lack of validation in the constructor for addresses such as _wiseLendingAddress, _pendleChilTokenAddress, etc. Consider enhancing the constructor by adding explicit checks to ensure none of these addresses are zero addresses. This not only prevents logical errors but also enhances the security of the contract by avoiding interactions with uninitialized addresses.

