# Vulnerability details

## Impact

The use of stale price data from the Oracle in the conversion process between USDC, OUSG, and rOUSG can result in inaccurate conversions.

## Proof of Concept

From overview: 

        Background on the OUSG Price Oracle
        The current price of OUSG is pulled from the oracle contract RWAOracleExternalComparisonCheck.sol. This oracle uses the change in the SHV ETF price (determined by pulling from a Chainlink Oracle) to constrain what price can be set by Ondo Finance.

The `RWAOracleExternalComparisonCheck` contract provides the last known RWA price and the timestamp of this price via the `getPriceData` function:

```solidity
        /**
        * @notice Retrieve the last set RWA price data
        *
        * @dev `price` is in 18 decimals, `timestamp` is unix seconds since epoch
        */
        function getPriceData()
            external
            view
            override
            returns (uint256 price, uint256 timestamp)
        {
            price = uint256(rwaPrice);
            timestamp = priceTimestamp;
        }
```

HOwever, In the contracts `OUSGInstantManager` and `ROUSG`, the price is fetched from the Oracle without checks for data recency. Stale data can be returned without detection, risking inaccurate token conversions.

```solidity
  function getOUSGPrice() public view returns (uint256 price) {
    (price, ) = oracle.getPriceData();
    require(
      price > MINIMUM_OUSG_PRICE,
      "OUSGInstantManager::getOUSGPrice: Price unexpectedly low"
    );
  }
```

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/11e77a3f64e7b055d12ccc914fa54051391ba24d/contracts/ousg/ousgInstantManager.sol#L479-L485
https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/4791cd1946f834f27addbc162c1817e897de7bf9/contracts/ousg/rOUSG.sol#L378-L380


We can also see that there are many reasons the RWA Oracle cannot timely update prices such as Chainlink Price oracle stale price or a price change that violates the max absolute change threshold.

```solidity
    if (block.timestamp > round.updatedAt + MAX_CL_WINDOW) {
      revert ChainlinkOraclePriceStale();
    }

    // Chainlink price update must not be comparing the same rounds against
    // eachother
    if (round.roundId == lastSetRound.roundId) {
      revert ChainlinkRoundNotUpdated();
    }

    // Ensure at least `MIN_PRICE_UPDATE_WINDOW` seconds have passed since
    // last RWA price update
    if (block.timestamp < priceTimestamp + MIN_PRICE_UPDATE_WINDOW) {
      revert PriceUpdateWindowViolation();
    }

    int256 rwaPriceChangeBps = _getPriceChangeBps(rwaPrice, newPrice);
    // Never allow a price change that violates the max absolute change
    // threshold.
    if (_abs_unsigned(rwaPriceChangeBps) > MAX_ABSOLUTE_DIFF_BPS) {
      revert AbsoluteDifferenceConstraintViolated();
    }

    int256 chainlinkPriceChangeBps = _getPriceChangeBps(
      lastSetRound.answer,
      round.answer
    );

    if (
      _abs_unsigned(chainlinkPriceChangeBps) <=
      MAX_ABSOLUTE_DIFF_BPS + MAX_CHANGE_DIFF_BPS
    ) {
      // Chainlink price change is sane, so we compare rwa price changes
      // against the Chainlink price changes.
      uint256 changeDifferenceBps = _abs_unsigned(
        rwaPriceChangeBps - chainlinkPriceChangeBps
      );

      if (changeDifferenceBps > MAX_CHANGE_DIFF_BPS) {
        revert DeltaDifferenceConstraintViolation();
      }
```

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/4791cd1946f834f27addbc162c1817e897de7bf9/contracts/rwaOracles/RWAOracleExternalComparisonCheck.sol#L155-L195

## Tools Used

Manual

## Recommended Mitigation Steps

Validate the timestamp to make sure `OUSGInstantManager` and `ROUSG` contracts don't consume stale price.

```diff
  function getOUSGPrice() public view returns (uint256 price) {
-   (price, ) = oracle.getPriceData();
+   (price, priceTimestamp) = oracle.getPriceData();
    require(
      price > MINIMUM_OUSG_PRICE,
      "OUSGInstantManager::getOUSGPrice: Price unexpectedly low"
    );
+   require(block.timestamp - priceTimestamp < maxTimestampDiff, "Price stale");
  }
```





