# Vulnerability details

## Impact
USDC is Pausable ERC20 that also has blacklist functionality - [source](https://etherscan.io/address/0x43506849d7c04f9138d1a2050bbf3a0c054402dd#code#F16#L52). It does check if `from` and `to` is not blacklisted. If they're - transaction reverts. In the case of blacklisting `feeReceiver`, users are unable to execute the:
- [mint](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/be2e9ebca6fca460c5b0253970ab280701a15ca1/contracts/ousg/ousgInstantManager.sol#L230-L241)
- [mintRebasingOUSG](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/be2e9ebca6fca460c5b0253970ab280701a15ca1/contracts/ousg/ousgInstantManager.sol#L254-L276)
- [redeem](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/be2e9ebca6fca460c5b0253970ab280701a15ca1/contracts/ousg/ousgInstantManager.sol#L335-L351)
- [redeemRebasingOUSG](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/be2e9ebca6fca460c5b0253970ab280701a15ca1/contracts/ousg/ousgInstantManager.sol#L335-L351)

## Proof of Concept
1. `feeReceiver` is blacklisted by USDC.
2. User wants to execute one of this functions:
- [mint](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/be2e9ebca6fca460c5b0253970ab280701a15ca1/contracts/ousg/ousgInstantManager.sol#L230-L241)
- [mintRebasingOUSG](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/be2e9ebca6fca460c5b0253970ab280701a15ca1/contracts/ousg/ousgInstantManager.sol#L254-L276)
- [redeem](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/be2e9ebca6fca460c5b0253970ab280701a15ca1/contracts/ousg/ousgInstantManager.sol#L335-L351)
- [redeemRebasingOUSG](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-ondo-finance/blob/be2e9ebca6fca460c5b0253970ab280701a15ca1/contracts/ousg/ousgInstantManager.sol#L335-L351)
3. For user - transaction unexpectedly reverts, because `feeReceiver` is blacklisted.


