## Recommended Mitigation Steps

Adding a 5 minute buffer to MAX_ANSWER_DELAY on latestChainlinkPrice will reduce the frequency of chainlink price returning zero.
```solidity
contract CoreChainlinkFeed is IPriceFeed
    {
@>  uint256 public BUFFER = 5 minutes;
    uint256 constant MAX_ANSWER_DELAY = 60 minutes + BUFFER;
}
```


