## Impact
`ibtRate` initialization is vulnerable to price manipulation. This allows an attacker to increase or decrease the price to carry out various attacks against the protocol.

## Proof of Concept
Consider the following scenario.

```
        if (
            _assetDecimals < MIN_DECIMALS ||
            _assetDecimals > _ibtDecimals ||
            _ibtDecimals > MAX_DECIMALS
        ) {
            revert InvalidDecimals();
        }
        ibt = _ibt;
        ibtUnit = 10 ** _ibtDecimals;
        ibtRate = IERC4626(ibt).previewRedeem(ibtUnit).toRay(_assetDecimals);
